Use in Badge OS
  Only src/vk/wallet/crypto.cpp includes these files, and only when VK_ED25519_BACKEND is 1
  (src/vk/vk_build.h; docs/os/wallet/signing.md, "Crypto backend"). It calls one function:

    int crypto_ed25519_check(const uint8_t signature[64], const uint8_t public_key[32],
                             const uint8_t *message, size_t message_size);   // 0 = valid, -1 = not

  Nothing in the firmware may call the signing functions in these files (crypto_ed25519_sign,
  crypto_eddsa_sign and the rest): the one signing path is signRaw() in src/vk/wallet/signer.cpp.

  Do not edit these files. To update, replace all four from one release tarball, update the
  checksums above and run test/host/run.sh test_mono.

Host test
  test/host/test_mono.c
